  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- First set opened as a trio with early material, starting with Up Shot, before horn players Zoidis and Casey joined [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **13s2t-1**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **13s2t-2**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **13s2t-3**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **13s2t-4**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **13s2t-5**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **13s2t-6**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **13s2t-7**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **13s2t-8**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2010-03-13** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 155 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Three sets of music that night; Warren Haynes, DJ Logic and the Shady Horns guested. DJ Logic's set between Soulive sets went unrecorded [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2010-03-13**: Recorded with a Rode NTG4 microphone into a Fostex FR2-LE at 24-bit/48 kHz; taped, transferred and seeded by BIGT [1]",
